          {
            "title": "Choose the request shape",
            "id": 152308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un panel necesita el informe <code>4</code> del proyecto <code>9</code>. ¿Qué ruta usa parámetros de ruta anidados?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>/projects/9/reports/4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>/projects?projectId=9&amp;reportId=4</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>/projects/4/reports/9</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>/projects/9/4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>/projects/9/reports/4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Build a focused query",
            "id": 152309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La URL ya filtra los elementos por <code>category=book</code>. Añade <code>owner=maya</code> como segundo parámetro de consulta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=book&amp;owner=maya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?owner=maya\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/owner/maya\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>&amp;owner=maya</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Combine dictionary filters",
            "id": 152310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>El diccionario ya filtra los libros por género. Añade una segunda entrada para el formato <code>ebook</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;genre&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;mystery&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;format&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;ebook&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;genre&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;paper&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"format\"</code> seguido de <code>\"ebook\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Send a filtered request",
            "id": 152311,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Usa `requests.get()` para enviar una solicitud a `url`. Pasa el diccionario `filters` mediante `params` y guarda la respuesta devuelta en `response`.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": false,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "script.py",
                  "codeLanguage": "python",
                  "content": "import requests\n\nurl = \"https://things.mimo.dev/api/things\"\nfilters = {\"category\": \"home\", \"owner\": \"Maya\"}\n",
                  "solvedContent": "import requests\n\nurl = \"https://things.mimo.dev/api/things\"\nfilters = {\"category\": \"home\", \"owner\": \"Maya\"}\nresponse = requests.get(url, params=filters)\n"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Predict the filtered URL",
            "id": 152312,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Que URL crea <code>requests.get()</code> a partir de este diccionario?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;category&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;tool&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;status&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url, params=filters)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=tool&amp;status=active</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things/category/tool/status/active</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=tool?status=active</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?tool=category&amp;active=status</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=tool&amp;status=active</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrange a nested route",
            "id": 152313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Coloca <code>shelf_id</code> después de <code>/shelves</code> y <code>book_id</code> después de <code>/books</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shelf_id = \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book_id = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"path = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;/shelves/\" /><text value=\"{shelf_id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/books/\" /><text value=\"{book_id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{book_id}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{shelf_id}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>{shelf_id}</code> seguido de <code>{book_id}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Build a nested request path",
            "id": 152314,
            "contentType": "executableFiles",
            "images": [],
            "executableContent": {
              "instructions": "Construye `path` con una f-string para que identifique el informe `4` del proyecto `9` como `/projects/9/reports/4`.",
              "preselectedFileIndex": 0,
              "hasVisualOutput": false,
              "files": [
                {
                  "name": "script.py",
                  "codeLanguage": "python",
                  "content": "project_id = 9\nreport_id = 4\npath = \"\"\n",
                  "solvedContent": "project_id = 9\nreport_id = 4\npath = f\"/projects/{project_id}/reports/{report_id}\"\n"
                }
              ],
              "hints": []
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Distinguish request parameters",
            "id": 152315,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esta solicitud se dirige al miembro <code>2</code> del equipo <code>5</code> y filtra los miembros activos. ¿Qué URL envía?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/teams/5/members/2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url, params=filters)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/teams/5/members/2?active=true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/teams?teamId=5&amp;memberId=2&amp;active=true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/teams/5/members/2/active/true</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/teams/2/members/5?active=true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/teams/5/members/2?active=true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
